OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fthe odd spot of rain through the
OL,7,Fevening. Mist and low cloud developing
OL,8,Fin places with showers developing into
OL,9,Fthe morning. Mild, and feeling very
OL,10,Fmuggy across the region.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA cloudy start with mist and
OL,13,Fisolated showers. A band of heavy
OL,14,Frain, with a risk of thunder, moves
OL,15,Fnorthwards across the area through the
OL,16,Fday clearing into the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
